<title>JAPAN: Japan's end-March pork stocks up 95.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan's end-March pork stocks up 95.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's pork stocks as of end-March reached 135,441 tonnes, down by 11.3 percent from end-February but up 95.8 percent from a year earlier, the Agriculture and Livestock Industries Corporation said on Friday.</p>
<p>The breakdown is as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Month	Mar 97     Feb 97	Mar 96    Mar 97/Mar 96</p>
<p> Total	135,441    152,623     69,178     +95.8 pct</p>
<p>  Domestic   17,490     17,467     10,630     +64.5 pct</p>
<p>  Imported  117,951    135,156     58,548     +101.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (+81-3-3432-7391)</p>
</text>
